# UI / UX

- One clear primary action per view
- Loading, error, and empty states are required for data views
- Prefer real product imagery/context over decorative filler when relevant
- Avoid generic AI-slop aesthetics (overused purple gradients, random pill clusters, empty card grids)
- Check mobile viewport for the demo path
- Do not ship broken focus rings or unlabeled inputs

Prompts: `prompts/ui/`
Workflow: `docs/workflows/ui-review.md`
